54.0, "width": 681, "height": 18, "text": "spans has NO foreign key into sampling_config -- the sampling decision travels", "originalText": "spans has NO foreign key into sampling_config -- the sampling decision travels", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 27}, {"id": "t27", "type": "text", "x": 167.5, "y": 572.0, "width": 689, "height": 18, "text": "with the trace context itself (module 02's 'sampled' field), never re-looked-up", "originalText": "with the trace context itself (module 02's 'sampled' field), never re-looked-up", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 28}, {"id": "t28", "type": "text", "x": 171.5, "y": 590.0, "width": 681, "height": 18, "text": "per span. Volume here is requests/sec x 20 services x sample_rate: write-once,", "originalText": "per span. Volume here is requests/sec x 20 services x sample_rate: write-once,", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 29}, {"id": "t29", "type": "text", "x": 167.5, "y": 608.0, "width": 689, "height": 18, "text": "almost never updated, sharded by trace_id so one trace is always a single-shard", "originalText": "almost never updated, sharded by trace_id so one trace is always a single-shard", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 30}, {"id": "t30", "type": "text", "x": 128.5, "y": 626.0, "width": 767, "height": 18, "text": "read. Retention (TTL) and sample_rate, not the storage engine, are the real cost levers.", "originalText": "read. Retention (TTL) and sample_rate, not the storage engine, are the real cost levers.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "opacity": 100, "seed": 31}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}}